WEBVTT

00:00:01.337 --> 00:00:02.000
SO HE COULD TRY
AND GET PAST

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:03.219
THAT 3-HEADED DOG.

00:00:03.263 --> 00:00:05.091
BUT HE GOT HIMSELF
BITTEN.

00:00:05.134 --> 00:00:06.396
THAT'S WHY
HE'S LIMPING.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.572
BUT WHY WOULD ANYONE
GO NEAR THAT DOG?

00:00:08.616 --> 00:00:10.444
THE DAY I WAS AT GRINGOTTS,

00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:12.707
HAGRID TOOK SOMETHING
OUT OF ONE OF THE VAULTS.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.882
SAID IT WAS
HOGWARTS BUSINESS,

00:00:13.925 --> 00:00:14.926
VERY SECRET.

00:00:15.971 --> 00:00:17.320
SO YOU'RE SAYING...

00:00:17.364 --> 00:00:19.105
THAT'S WHAT
THE DOG'S GUARDING.

00:00:19.148 --> 00:00:21.194
THAT'S
WHAT SNAPE WANTS.

00:00:21.237 --> 00:00:23.021
[OWL SCREECHES]

00:00:34.381 --> 00:00:36.426
BIT EARLY FOR MAIL,
ISN'T IT?

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.168
BUT I--I NEVER GET MAIL.

00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:41.257
LET'S OPEN IT.

00:00:51.354 --> 00:00:52.660
IT'S A BROOMSTICK.

00:00:52.703 --> 00:00:55.184
THAT'S NOT JUST
A BROOMSTICK, HARRY.

00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:57.578
IT'S A NIMBUS 2000.

00:00:58.709 --> 00:00:59.928
BUT WHO?

00:01:22.429 --> 00:01:23.386
SCARED, HARRY?

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.127
A LITTLE.

00:01:25.171 --> 00:01:26.563
THAT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:01:26.607 --> 00:01:29.087
I FELT THE SAME WAY
BEFORE MY FIRST GAME.

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:30.393
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:01:30.437 --> 00:01:32.743
I, UH, I DON'T
REALLY REMEMBER.

00:01:32.787 --> 00:01:35.137
I TOOK A BLUDGER TO
THE HEAD 2 MINUTES IN.

00:01:35.181 --> 00:01:37.792
WOKE UP IN THE HOSPITAL
A WEEK LATER.

00:01:40.098 --> 00:01:42.100
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:02:00.771 --> 00:02:03.034
HELLO, AND WELCOME
TO HOGWARTS' FIRST

00:02:03.078 --> 00:02:04.297
QUIDDITCH GAME
OF THE SEASON.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:07.822
TODAY'S GAME--
SLYTHERIN VERSUS GRYFFINDOR!

00:02:07.865 --> 00:02:10.216
[CHEERING]

00:02:14.045 --> 00:02:16.004
GRYFFINDOR!

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:41.334
Lee: THE PLAYERS
TAKE THEIR POSITIONS

00:02:41.377 --> 00:02:43.553
AS MADAME HOOCH
STEPS OUT ONTO THE FIELD

00:02:43.597 --> 00:02:46.034
TO BEGIN THE GAME!

00:02:46.077 --> 00:02:49.646
NOW I WANT
A NICE CLEAN GAME...

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.692
FROM ALL OF YOU!

00:02:57.959 --> 00:02:59.308
Lee: THE BLUDGERS ARE UP...

00:02:59.352 --> 00:03:01.136
FOLLOWED BY
THE GOLDEN SNITCH.

00:03:01.179 --> 00:03:03.269
REMEMBER, THE SNITCH
IS WORTH 150 POINTS.

00:03:03.312 --> 00:03:07.969
THE SEEKER WHO CATCHES
THE SNITCH ENDS THE GAME.

00:03:13.148 --> 00:03:14.932
THE QUAFFLE IS RELEASED...

00:03:14.976 --> 00:03:17.935
AND THE GAME BEGINS!

00:03:34.474 --> 00:03:36.432
[BELL RINGS]

00:03:36.476 --> 00:03:40.697
ANGELINA JOHNSON SCORES!
10 POINTS FOR GRYFFINDOR!

00:03:43.483 --> 00:03:45.354
YES! WHOA.

00:03:46.442 --> 00:03:47.878
WELL DONE!

00:03:51.795 --> 00:03:54.450
Lee: SLYTHERIN TAKES
POSSESSION OF THE QUAFFLE.

00:03:54.494 --> 00:03:57.192
BLETCHLEY PASSES
TO CAPTAIN MARCUS FLINT.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.962
[BELL RINGS]

00:04:29.006 --> 00:04:30.051
YES!

00:04:30.094 --> 00:04:32.880
ANOTHER 10 POINTS
TO GRYFFINDOR!

00:04:46.154 --> 00:04:47.808
GIVE ME THAT!

00:04:56.251 --> 00:04:58.427
[CROWD BOOING]

00:05:00.908 --> 00:05:03.476
[LAUGHING]

00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:13.616
[BELL RINGS]

00:05:19.927 --> 00:05:21.798
TAKE THAT SIDE.

00:05:47.128 --> 00:05:48.521
[BELL RINGS]

00:06:09.411 --> 00:06:11.587
WHOA! WHOA!

00:06:11.631 --> 00:06:14.721
Hagrid: WHAT'S GOING ON
WITH HARRY'S BROOMSTICK?

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.733
IT'S SNAPE!
HE'S JINXING THE BROOM!

00:06:26.776 --> 00:06:28.996
JINXING THE BROOM?
WHAT DO WE DO?

00:06:29.039 --> 00:06:30.388
LEAVE IT TO ME.

00:06:52.585 --> 00:06:54.412
COME ON, HERMIONE!

00:07:08.252 --> 00:07:10.603
LACARNUM INFLAMARAE.

00:07:19.046 --> 00:07:20.177
FIRE!

00:07:20.221 --> 00:07:21.439
YOU'RE ON FIRE!

00:07:21.483 --> 00:07:22.658
WHAT? OH!

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:40.937
GO!

00:07:40.981 --> 00:07:42.243
GO, GO, GO!

00:08:20.934 --> 00:08:22.675
UNH!

00:08:27.854 --> 00:08:29.116
[ALL GASPING]

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.644
LOOKS LIKE HE'S GONNA BE SICK.

00:08:37.603 --> 00:08:39.126
Lee:
HE'S GOT THE SNITCH!

00:08:39.169 --> 00:08:41.694
HARRY POTTER
RECEIVES 150 POINTS

00:08:41.737 --> 00:08:42.695
FOR CATCHING THE SNITCH.

00:08:42.738 --> 00:08:45.393
[FWEET]
GRYFFINDOR WINS.

00:08:45.436 --> 00:08:47.351
[CHEERING]

00:08:48.918 --> 00:08:49.782
NO.

